{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56284","headline":"碁 · 欧阳炯","name":"碁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碁理还将道理通，爲饶先手却由衰。\n古人重到今人爱，万局都无一局同。\n静算山川千里近，闲销日月两轮空。\n诚知此道刚难进，况是平生不着功。\n（《事文类聚前集》卷四二。\n）（按：《韵语阳秋》卷十七引三、四两句，《全唐诗》卷七六一收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}